# Override the refusal message the input rail emits when it blocks, so it carries a marker the app
# detects ("scoped to your customer accounts"). No dialog flows / embeddings — input self-check only.
define bot refuse to respond
  "🛡️ I'm scoped to your customer accounts and technology research — I can't help with that here. Try asking about a customer, their tech stack, a briefing, or whether a product fits."
